            ↓
       FRONTEND UI
            ↓
       HTTP REQUEST
            ↓
      BACKEND / API
            ↓
     BUSINESS LOGIC
            ↓
        DATABASE
            ↓
       DATA RESPONSE
            ↓
       BACKEND / API
            ↓
       FRONTEND UI
            ↓
